Select text, then copy/cut/paste it with the cmd-c/cmd-x/cmd-v keys, exercising
the CUT/COPY/PASTE branches of the typing handler.

-- input --
type hello world test
move 30 10
button 1
move 110 10
button 0
key cmd-c
key cmd-x
key cmd-v
-- waitframes --
29 33 37 41 45 49 53 57 61 65 69 73 77 81 85 89 93 93 95 98 98 98 106 117
